  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-editorial\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #34444b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 677px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; text-align: justify; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"color: #34444b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><span class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">01</span>从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 750\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"background-color: #edf7f7; border-left: 1px solid #087f8c; color: #075a63; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; padding: 16px 18px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\" data-no-dark=\"\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><span class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">02</span>三个可以马上检查的地方</h2></section><ul style=\"background-color: #f7f9f8; border-left: 1px solid #087f8c; margin: 0 0 15px; padding: 14px 16px 14px 36px; padding-left: 22px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/r