" data-no-dark=\"\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #badbdf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"color: #17242b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"><span class=\"cw-layout-section-number\" style=\"background-color: #087f8c; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.7; margin-right: 9px; padding: 1px 8px; vertical-align: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">03</span>把风格落实到每一个细节</h2></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.92; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.92; margin: 0 0 15px; text-align: justify\" data-no-dark=\"\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><p style=\"background-color: #edf7f7; border-top: 3px solid #087f8c; color: #34444b; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 